+2.  **Calculate Inter-Region Distances:**
+    For every pair of regions $(R_i, R_j)$, compute Euclidean distance between their means:
+    $$ D(R_i, R_j) = \sqrt{(\mu_{ix} - \mu_{jx})^2 + (\mu_{iy} - \mu_{jy})^2 + (\mu_{iz} - \mu_{jz})^2} $$
 
